    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to"
  },
